    {
     "author": {
      "accountId": "5fca8aeffacfd6007656bf65",
      "accountType": "atlassian",
      "active": true,
      "avatarUrls": {
       "16x16": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/5fca8aeffacfd6007656bf65/9af2a4f1-6b52-480b-a69f-d59b265be598/16",
       "24x24": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/5fca8aeffacfd6007656bf65/9af2a4f1-6b52-480b-a69f-d59b265be598/24",
       "32x32": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/5fca8aeffacfd6007656bf65/9af2a4f1-6b52-480b-a69f-d59b265be598/32",
       "48x48": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/5fca8aeffacfd6007656bf65/9af2a4f1-6b52-480b-a69f-d59b265be598/48"
      },
      "displayName": "Esmé Cowles",
      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=5fca8aeffacfd6007656bf65",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": {
      "content": [
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "attrs": {
           "accessLevel": "",
           "id": "6089a519bb0b0500707c7173",
           "text": "@Adam Wead"
          },
          "type": "mention"
         },
         {
          "text": ", yes, I think that's the way to go.  You might want to add some children of a resource with hasMember links to have both ldp:contains and pcdm:hasMember on the same resource.  Then you can set --predicate to ",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "marks": [
           {
            "attrs": {
             "href": "http://pcdm.org/models#hasMember"
            },
            "type": "link"
           }
          ],
          "text": "http://pcdm.org/models#hasMember",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "text": " and it should export the members, but not things that are directly contained.  Setting it to ",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "marks": [
           {
            "attrs": {
             "href": "http://pcdm.org/models#hasMember,http://www.w3.org/ns/ldp#contains"
            },
            "type": "link"
           }
          ],
          "text": "http://pcdm.org/models#hasMember,http://www.w3.org/ns/ldp#contains",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "text": " should export both.",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       }
      ],
      "type": "doc",
      "version": 1
     },
