      },
      "displayName": "Adam Wead",
      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=6089a519bb0b0500707c7173",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p><a href=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=5fca8aeffacfd6007656bf65\" class=\"user-hover\" rel=\"5fca8aeffacfd6007656bf65\" data-account-id=\"5fca8aeffacfd6007656bf65\" accountid=\"5fca8aeffacfd6007656bf65\" rel=\"noreferrer\">Esmé Cowles</a> Suggestions on how to test this? Go to an endpoint that has a hasMember predicate and see if its resources are exported?</p>",
     "created": "09/Dec/16 10:33 AM",
     "id": "18116",
     "jsdPublic": true,
